(1197358, 151053, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool way to make a natural frame out of the shot, assuming it''s legal :)  In totally unrelated news, this shot marks the 50,000th vote I''ve cast since joining DPC!</td>', 'Cool way to make a natural frame out of the shot, assuming it''s legal :)  In totally unrelated news, this shot marks the 50,000th vote I''ve cast since joining DPC!', '2005-02-28 00:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
