(1197419, 150959, 31213, '<td valign="top">Whats up with the edge of the cookie?  Cut out in Photoshop?  Love the idea, composition and creativity!  Nice work.</td>', 'Whats up with the edge of the cookie?  Cut out in Photoshop?  Love the idea, composition and creativity!  Nice work.', '2005-02-28 00:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
