(1197603, 150996, 31213, '<td valign="top">You missed the point of the challenge.  It wasnt for you to take a picture OF a billboard...it was for your image to be that of something you''d likey see on a billboard.  You image itself is supposed to be the billboard.  You''re gunna get hammered for this....sorry!</td>', 'You missed the point of the challenge.  It wasnt for you to take a picture OF a billboard...it was for your image to be that of something you''d likey see on a billboard.  You image itself is supposed to be the billboard.  You''re gunna get hammered for this....sorry!', '2005-02-28 00:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
