(1197629, 150584, 16648, '<td valign="top">I hope you do not get hit score wise for words. Mine has them too....I thought about this message, but went a different way. nicely done.</td>', 'I hope you do not get hit score wise for words. Mine has them too....I thought about this message, but went a different way. nicely done.', '2005-02-28 00:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
