(1197636, 151060, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but there should be an area for the printed message that does not get lost in the image itself. Too centered Me things, and the product is VERY small for a billboard.</td>', 'Nice pic, but there should be an area for the printed message that does not get lost in the image itself. Too centered Me things, and the product is VERY small for a billboard.', '2005-02-28 01:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197637, 150757, 24976, '<td valign="top">lol! i love the concept<br/>i would have cropped out the stuff above the fence thought, it has no purpose and is distracting. but good shot</td>', 'lol! i love the concepti would have cropped out the stuff above the fence thought, it has no purpose and is distracting. but good shot', '2005-02-28 01:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197638, 150727, 31213, '<td valign="top">LOL.  The idea is phenominal- 10 quality<br/> <br/>Composition is pretty good too....it would be a 10 if the cats head wasn''t blocked by the faucet.<br/> <br/>Post production work- This is kind of what kills ya....the cat is obviously cut out....I think with a little more time you could have made that look a LOT smoother.  <br/> <br/>After all of that....I''ll give you a 7 to start, just because its so cute and clever.  Nice work.</td>', 'LOL.  The idea is phenominal- 10 quality Composition is pretty good too....it would be a 10 if the cats head wasn''t blocked by the faucet. Post production work- This is kind of what kills ya....the cat is obviously cut out....I think with a little more time you could have made that look a LOT smoother.   After all of that....I''ll give you a 7 to start, just because its so cute and clever.  Nice work.', '2005-02-28 01:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197641, 150441, 31213, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Gave me a good laugh.  Ncie job.</td>', 'LOL.  Gave me a good laugh.  Ncie job.', '2005-02-28 01:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
