(1197665, 150824, 24976, '<td valign="top">good use of color... i dont like that i can see a white outline between the apple and the background... a quick way to get rid of it is to take the brush tool, set the opacity to around 30% and using a small brush size and the color from you background to just paint the white over with red as needed</td>', 'good use of color... i dont like that i can see a white outline between the apple and the background... a quick way to get rid of it is to take the brush tool, set the opacity to around 30% and using a small brush size and the color from you background to just paint the white over with red as needed', '2005-02-28 01:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197666, 151130, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast and colors.....not too saturated like a lot of people would do with this.  Nice job.  Having trouble connecting the title to the image though.  Zebra petterned PJs?  Zebra looks tired?  Hmmm</td>', 'Love the contrast and colors.....not too saturated like a lot of people would do with this.  Nice job.  Having trouble connecting the title to the image though.  Zebra petterned PJs?  Zebra looks tired?  Hmmm', '2005-02-28 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
