(1198054, 151128, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, sharp, well-composed. It''s made no allowance, however, for the text. Certainly not for as much text as you''ve used in the title.  Strong image.</td>', 'Beautiful, sharp, well-composed. It''s made no allowance, however, for the text. Certainly not for as much text as you''ve used in the title.  Strong image.', '2005-02-28 03:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
