(1198406, 150617, 29269, '<td valign="top">For a billboard, I imagine that the text would be printed in the top 3rd. Therefore, this would have been better with the bottom cropper... wait, I just realized that the letters could be white (light) and fit in the bottom half. That would make it much better, bumping up.</td>', 'For a billboard, I imagine that the text would be printed in the top 3rd. Therefore, this would have been better with the bottom cropper... wait, I just realized that the letters could be white (light) and fit in the bottom half. That would make it much better, bumping up.', '2005-02-28 09:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198410, 150584, 29269, '<td valign="top">I imagine you printed the sign w/text, laid it on the table, put the key in the glass and laid it down... maybe you should have had this validated to eliminate low scores from suspicious people that will think that you added text.<br/>One suggestion - you should have made the letters heavier - using extra bold typeface perhaps.</td>', 'I imagine you printed the sign w/text, laid it on the table, put the key in the glass and laid it down... maybe you should have had this validated to eliminate low scores from suspicious people that will think that you added text.One suggestion - you should have made the letters heavier - using extra bold typeface perhaps.', '2005-02-28 09:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
