(1198752, 150476, 4285, '<td valign="top">I think white would have been a better choice for a background colour, mainly because the gray you used is almost the same as the gray of the site and it tends to blend in rather than stand out. Otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'I think white would have been a better choice for a background colour, mainly because the gray you used is almost the same as the gray of the site and it tends to blend in rather than stand out. Otherwise a good shot.', '2005-02-28 12:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
