(1198767, 151023, 21362, '<td valign="top">And that''s really an advertising slogan used here isn''t it? (I''m also from Oregon.)<br/> <br/>Lovely as usual Zoomdak.  ETA: Oops. I guess it isn''t him afterall. Another Oregonian though... Thinking I need to get myself out to the coast at sunset one of these days for a shiny sand reflection shot. ;)</td>', 'And that''s really an advertising slogan used here isn''t it? (I''m also from Oregon.) Lovely as usual Zoomdak.  ETA: Oops. I guess it isn''t him afterall. Another Oregonian though... Thinking I need to get myself out to the coast at sunset one of these days for a shiny sand reflection shot. ;)', '2005-02-28 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198768, 150384, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea..one of my favorites..love the open window effect!</td>', 'Very unique idea..one of my favorites..love the open window effect!', '2005-02-28 13:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198769, 150703, 32754, '<td valign="top">This shot is a 10...it is a fabulous advertising billboard shot..soft colors, great image...wonderful idea.</td>', 'This shot is a 10...it is a fabulous advertising billboard shot..soft colors, great image...wonderful idea.', '2005-02-28 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198776, 150648, 10080, '<td valign="top">Wow!! Provocative and well done! 9</td>', 'Wow!! Provocative and well done! 9', '2005-02-28 13:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198777, 150751, 4285, '<td valign="top">More DOF for this type of shot would have worked better. I think shallow DOF would be lost on most motorists. Not only that, you are advertising so you want to present the most undistorted / clean image of your product possible. Great concept nonetheless.</td>', 'More DOF for this type of shot would have worked better. I think shallow DOF would be lost on most motorists. Not only that, you are advertising so you want to present the most undistorted / clean image of your product possible. Great concept nonetheless.', '2005-02-28 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198779, 150959, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool original shot..love it!</td>', 'This is a very cool original shot..love it!', '2005-02-28 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198780, 150748, 32754, '<td valign="top">This really made me laugh out loud..great shot..and title!</td>', 'This really made me laugh out loud..great shot..and title!', '2005-02-28 13:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198782, 150748, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very clever!! Nice that you left enough empty space for text, too. I think this is a great shot in every way - nothing to add in the way of constructive (or other :-) criticism.</td>', 'Very clever!! Nice that you left enough empty space for text, too. I think this is a great shot in every way - nothing to add in the way of constructive (or other :-) criticism.', '2005-02-28 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198783, 151023, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors,  definitely induces one to start dreaming of Oregon...great ad.</td>', 'Lovely colors,  definitely induces one to start dreaming of Oregon...great ad.', '2005-02-28 13:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198790, 151012, 10080, '<td valign="top">Great execution. The design and the use of dof is well done. My only nit pik would be that the reflection could have been much more interesting. nice job.8</td>', 'Great execution. The design and the use of dof is well done. My only nit pik would be that the reflection could have been much more interesting. nice job.8', '2005-02-28 13:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198791, 150728, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very touching image..effective shot.</td>', 'Very touching image..effective shot.', '2005-02-28 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198795, 151130, 32754, '<td valign="top">Great shot and title!  Love this billboard.</td>', 'Great shot and title!  Love this billboard.', '2005-02-28 13:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198802, 150643, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think the snow on the sand  is incredibly beautiful, but the sun on the water is a little too strong for my taste - it detracts from that awesome, snow-covered sand. Otherwise, it''s a really nice composition. I can imagine the text being placed on the water in the upper right area. Perfect slogan.</td>', 'I think the snow on the sand  is incredibly beautiful, but the sun on the water is a little too strong for my taste - it detracts from that awesome, snow-covered sand. Otherwise, it''s a really nice composition. I can imagine the text being placed on the water in the upper right area. Perfect slogan.', '2005-02-28 13:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198803, 150815, 10080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and creativity. I like the idea alot. It really is too bright. I think darker and maybe a shadow to show depth would have helped this. Keep shooting creatively! 6</td>', 'Wonderful idea and creativity. I like the idea alot. It really is too bright. I think darker and maybe a shadow to show depth would have helped this. Keep shooting creatively! 6', '2005-02-28 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1198807, 150938, 10080, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Great idea. A little water movement or ripple would have made it perfect, but still a nice shot. 9</td>', 'Nicely done! Great idea. A little water movement or ripple would have made it perfect, but still a nice shot. 9', '2005-02-28 13:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
