(1199725, 150887, 21362, '<td valign="top">That''s beautiful. I wish the boat at the bottom wasn''t cropped off though. Maybe it''s intact in the non-billboard sized original? <br/> <br/>Not entirely convinced I see this as a billboard advertisement, but it''s a lovely photo nonetheless.</td>', 'That''s beautiful. I wish the boat at the bottom wasn''t cropped off though. Maybe it''s intact in the non-billboard sized original?  Not entirely convinced I see this as a billboard advertisement, but it''s a lovely photo nonetheless.', '2005-02-28 19:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
