(1200138, 151106, 10080, '<td valign="top">What a GREAT capture! He is focused on perfectly! The lighting and the colors are really good. You should try to get him to look at this one. It would make a great vegas billboard. 9</td>', 'What a GREAT capture! He is focused on perfectly! The lighting and the colors are really good. You should try to get him to look at this one. It would make a great vegas billboard. 9', '2005-02-28 22:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
