(1201156, 151131, 31865, '<td valign="top">don''t feel too bad about misreading the challenge.  I thought the same thing at first and probably wouldn''t have noticed except for a forum thread.  Anyway, this is a really nice photo of an actual billboard.  I like the colors and the wall behind it.</td>', 'don''t feel too bad about misreading the challenge.  I thought the same thing at first and probably wouldn''t have noticed except for a forum thread.  Anyway, this is a really nice photo of an actual billboard.  I like the colors and the wall behind it.', '2005-03-01 14:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
