(1203915, 150643, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  not sure I would recognize this.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Hmmm... <br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? That depends...<br/>4. Extra thoughts: A very beautiful photo. But I''m afraid it does not serves it''s purpose well here.<br/>If I drove by it, I would need a lot more then a quick glance to understand what I see. Gave you a 6 just cause the photo itself really is beautiful.<br/></td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  not sure I would recognize this.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Hmmm... 3. Did you sell your stuff to me? That depends...4. Extra thoughts: A very beautiful photo. But I''m afraid it does not serves it''s purpose well here.If I drove by it, I would need a lot more then a quick glance to understand what I see. Gave you a 6 just cause the photo itself really is beautiful.', '2005-03-02 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203962, 151023, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? hmm.... not sure.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? If I got to read the test I might be considering buying.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: Beautiful shot. Bright and eye catching. The kind I would enjoy looking at, after a long day at work, on my way home.<br/>But sunsets are corny and not exactly representing one place or another.<br/>most likely I would forget the picture after driving away.<br/>If I saw this while standing at the traffic lights, I would probably be interested in a trip to Oregon. So I give you a 7 for a beautiful photo.</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? hmm.... not sure.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? If I got to read the test I might be considering buying.4. Extra thoughts: Beautiful shot. Bright and eye catching. The kind I would enjoy looking at, after a long day at work, on my way home.But sunsets are corny and not exactly representing one place or another.most likely I would forget the picture after driving away.If I saw this while standing at the traffic lights, I would probably be interested in a trip to Oregon. So I give you a 7 for a beautiful photo.', '2005-03-02 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203977, 150703, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? hmm....<br/>4. Extra thoughts: Beautiful photo, wonderful lighting, nice colors.<br/>The part of the hand (?) on the left is a bit distracting IMO. Also, just one model alone. The "united" is quite missing. (7)</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? hmm....4. Extra thoughts: Beautiful photo, wonderful lighting, nice colors.The part of the hand (?) on the left is a bit distracting IMO. Also, just one model alone. The "united" is quite missing. (7)', '2005-03-02 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204014, 150441, 31167, '<td valign="top">This is great.  The hockey helmet is a nice touch.  Maybe I''m a little biased being a canuck though eh.</td>', 'This is great.  The hockey helmet is a nice touch.  Maybe I''m a little biased being a canuck though eh.', '2005-03-02 18:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204022, 150959, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? I''m avoiding milk for health reasons. But if I would use it, I would probably go to the next store and get some.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: Funny, surprising, eye catching.<br/>The focus is a bit too soft and the white of the milk is a bit too white.<br/>To the photo itself I would give a 5 but as a billboard you sell well. bumping up to 7.</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? I''m avoiding milk for health reasons. But if I would use it, I would probably go to the next store and get some.4. Extra thoughts: Funny, surprising, eye catching.The focus is a bit too soft and the white of the milk is a bit too white.To the photo itself I would give a 5 but as a billboard you sell well. bumping up to 7.', '2005-03-02 18:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204035, 151119, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Only if I''m hungry.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: The use of negative space is nice and the details of the photo are good. The whites are nicely balanced.<br/>The lighting is flat and I don''t like the huge reflection of the light at the center top of the photo. <br/>the DOF is a bit too shallow and over all there''s nothing new and exciting about this billboard. Just another one I pass on my way and forget a minute later. (5)</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Only if I''m hungry.4. Extra thoughts: The use of negative space is nice and the details of the photo are good. The whites are nicely balanced.The lighting is flat and I don''t like the huge reflection of the light at the center top of the photo. the DOF is a bit too shallow and over all there''s nothing new and exciting about this billboard. Just another one I pass on my way and forget a minute later. (5)', '2005-03-02 18:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204042, 150744, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  i guess so.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? no words are needed.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? not sure.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: A nice advertising photo of the car. The center works pretty well here. Nice copywriting.<br/>The lights at the bottom are distracting. The lights at the top are reflecting in the side mirrors and I do not find this too appealing.<br/>The focus is a bit too soft. Over all it is too standart view of a too standart product. Not the one that will make me think about after passing it by. (5)<br/></td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  i guess so.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? no words are needed.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? not sure.4. Extra thoughts: A nice advertising photo of the car. The center works pretty well here. Nice copywriting.The lights at the bottom are distracting. The lights at the top are reflecting in the side mirrors and I do not find this too appealing.The focus is a bit too soft. Over all it is too standart view of a too standart product. Not the one that will make me think about after passing it by. (5)', '2005-03-02 18:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204051, 150470, 11793, '<td valign="top">would work - except where would the text go?<br/>good luck</td>', 'would work - except where would the text go?good luck', '2005-03-02 18:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204052, 150748, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Eummm... what exactly are you selling?<br/>4. Extra thoughts: The photo is cure and funny but I have no idea what you are trying to sell. <br/>Don''t forget that people in the street do not have the time nor do they have the will to stay and think about your idea. A billboard should be very clear in it''s message. Or, if it is just a teaser, it should make me wonder what''s coming next.<br/>In this photo, the message is not clear to me and the dog is too relaxed to make me wonder what''s coming next.<br/>Also your lighting (or white balance?) needs to be reviewd. <br/>IMO your billboard did not serve it''s purpose, but I will give you a 6 for a funny photo.</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Eummm... what exactly are you selling?4. Extra thoughts: The photo is cure and funny but I have no idea what you are trying to sell. Don''t forget that people in the street do not have the time nor do they have the will to stay and think about your idea. A billboard should be very clear in it''s message. Or, if it is just a teaser, it should make me wonder what''s coming next.In this photo, the message is not clear to me and the dog is too relaxed to make me wonder what''s coming next.Also your lighting (or white balance?) needs to be reviewd. IMO your billboard did not serve it''s purpose, but I will give you a 6 for a funny photo.', '2005-03-02 18:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204058, 150522, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  ummm... not sure. <br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: what are you trying to sell exactly?<br/>I truely don''t mean to offend, but I don''t find this photo appealing to me esthetically, nor is it interesting as an advertisement.<br/>I don''t get your idea here, and I don''t think this photo is serving any porpose as a billboard.</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  ummm... not sure. 2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No.4. Extra thoughts: what are you trying to sell exactly?I truely don''t mean to offend, but I don''t find this photo appealing to me esthetically, nor is it interesting as an advertisement.I don''t get your idea here, and I don''t think this photo is serving any porpose as a billboard.', '2005-03-02 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204061, 151092, 11793, '<td valign="top">it''s a well done photo, but i only think i  know what you''re advertising, and it''s unlikey i would ever pass by it at 9 o''clock.  i may have had him frown.<br/> <br/>photo wise - the edge of the face seems a bit weird.  too pink, and kind of blown out.  composition is good.<br/> <br/>good luck<br/></td>', 'it''s a well done photo, but i only think i  know what you''re advertising, and it''s unlikey i would ever pass by it at 9 o''clock.  i may have had him frown. photo wise - the edge of the face seems a bit weird.  too pink, and kind of blown out.  composition is good. good luck', '2005-03-02 18:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
