(1204709, 150658, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, but there is no real pop.  Another thing to consider is that the RSPCA is not exactly an organization that I think everyone would know about simply by it''s acronym.  Put the two together and it comes out kinda confusing and (IMHO) not terribly effective.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice and simple, but there is no real pop.  Another thing to consider is that the RSPCA is not exactly an organization that I think everyone would know about simply by it''s acronym.  Put the two together and it comes out kinda confusing and (IMHO) not terribly effective.TC', '2005-03-02 23:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
