(1204998, 150990, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? I think so.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? I do not believe in the lottery, so you didn''t see to me. But I''m sure you sold your stuff to some others.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: The photo itself could use some better PP. The whites are not balanced, the flash is reflecting all over, the money in the background could use some more contrast. <br/>But the composition is great and well selling and as a billboard this is the most important thing. Bumping up.<br/></td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes.2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? I think so.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? I do not believe in the lottery, so you didn''t see to me. But I''m sure you sold your stuff to some others.4. Extra thoughts: The photo itself could use some better PP. The whites are not balanced, the flash is reflecting all over, the money in the background could use some more contrast. But the composition is great and well selling and as a billboard this is the most important thing. Bumping up.', '2005-03-03 04:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
