(1205970, 150568, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Not sure.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? not sure.<br/>4. Extra thoughts:  The photo is great. I love it. But as a billboard I''m afraid it doesn''t work well. <br/>It is too busy and too sophisticated. If all I have to see your billboard is a brief second while driving, I will never get it.<br/>Ok, I got the cookies, but why are the crumbs in the cup with the milk?<br/>I needed a few long minutes to understand it was some kind of coffee shake. I would never spend so much time on a billboard. <br/>Gave you a 6 for just a nice photo.<br/></td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Not sure.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? not sure.4. Extra thoughts:  The photo is great. I love it. But as a billboard I''m afraid it doesn''t work well. It is too busy and too sophisticated. If all I have to see your billboard is a brief second while driving, I will never get it.Ok, I got the cookies, but why are the crumbs in the cup with the milk?I needed a few long minutes to understand it was some kind of coffee shake. I would never spend so much time on a billboard. Gave you a 6 for just a nice photo.', '2005-03-03 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205977, 150674, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No<br/>4. Extra thoughts: The photo is amazing. I would expect it to publish some wild life reservation park or a trip to africa. <br/>Oats? is that all? How does the product look? How can I recognize it in the store? What is the connection to this sad looking tiger? <br/>As a billboard you did not serve the purpose at all IMO. Gave you a 6 for an excellent photo.</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No4. Extra thoughts: The photo is amazing. I would expect it to publish some wild life reservation park or a trip to africa. Oats? is that all? How does the product look? How can I recognize it in the store? What is the connection to this sad looking tiger? As a billboard you did not serve the purpose at all IMO. Gave you a 6 for an excellent photo.', '2005-03-03 16:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205982, 150502, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No words needed<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Yes<br/>4. Extra thoughts: As a billboard you serve the purpose very well. The message is very clear, easy to understand even if I only saw it for a very brief second.<br/>The only suggestions for improvement that I have are about the photo.<br/>IMO the bottle should have been streight and not tilted to the right.<br/>A little bit of brightness would help, especially in getting the name of the product to stand out some more. You are selling a brand. Not just water. (7)<br/></td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No words needed3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Yes4. Extra thoughts: As a billboard you serve the purpose very well. The message is very clear, easy to understand even if I only saw it for a very brief second.The only suggestions for improvement that I have are about the photo.IMO the bottle should have been streight and not tilted to the right.A little bit of brightness would help, especially in getting the name of the product to stand out some more. You are selling a brand. Not just water. (7)', '2005-03-03 16:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205988, 150658, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No<br/>4. Extra thoughts: I have no idea what RSPCA is, so I''ll guess it is some kind of animals shelter. Assuming that, I have a question:<br/>If this shelter have such a lovely green park for the dogs to wonder around, why do they need my help? They have it all! Places who have those tiny cages need my help.<br/>This is just a nice picture of a cute dog. Nothing more then that.<br/>As a billboard I don''t think it praises what it''s want to sell correctly. (6)</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No4. Extra thoughts: I have no idea what RSPCA is, so I''ll guess it is some kind of animals shelter. Assuming that, I have a question:If this shelter have such a lovely green park for the dogs to wonder around, why do they need my help? They have it all! Places who have those tiny cages need my help.This is just a nice picture of a cute dog. Nothing more then that.As a billboard I don''t think it praises what it''s want to sell correctly. (6)', '2005-03-03 16:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
