(1206213, 150630, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No.<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? not really.<br/>4. Extra thoughts: The photo is great. Clean and clear. But as a billboard? I don''t know. I''m not curious to know what you''re selling. The tiny bottle makes me think of anti-coughing syrup, The transperant look of it don''t help me connect the bottle to the oranges.<br/>the only thing in favour of this shot as a billboard is that Absolut sells itself. (6)</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No.3. Did you sell your stuff to me? not really.4. Extra thoughts: The photo is great. Clean and clear. But as a billboard? I don''t know. I''m not curious to know what you''re selling. The tiny bottle makes me think of anti-coughing syrup, The transperant look of it don''t help me connect the bottle to the oranges.the only thing in favour of this shot as a billboard is that Absolut sells itself. (6)', '2005-03-03 17:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
