(1206265, 150967, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a strong shot - but, despite having a vivid imagination, I can''t read anything appropriate to sell with this shot - apart from a Raymond Weil wristwatch. If it had a pack shot of the watch in the corner, the title could have been "Make Every Second Count"...<br/> <br/>It''s a lovely image by the way.</td>', 'It''s a strong shot - but, despite having a vivid imagination, I can''t read anything appropriate to sell with this shot - apart from a Raymond Weil wristwatch. If it had a pack shot of the watch in the corner, the title could have been "Make Every Second Count"... It''s a lovely image by the way.', '2005-03-03 18:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
