(1207406, 150584, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No<br/>4. Extra thoughts:  First - bumping up just for being validated! I was one of those who requested a DQ for the text here.  But now that it''s valid, I must say you did a wonderful work with it!<br/>As for the billbaord, the idea is nice but I don''t feel it is strong enough.<br/>The photo is good and deserve the score. But the concept as a whole is missing something... (6)<br/></td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? Yes3. Did you sell your stuff to me? No4. Extra thoughts:  First - bumping up just for being validated! I was one of those who requested a DQ for the text here.  But now that it''s valid, I must say you did a wonderful work with it!As for the billbaord, the idea is nice but I don''t feel it is strong enough.The photo is good and deserve the score. But the concept as a whole is missing something... (6)', '2005-03-04 10:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207419, 151034, 25655, '<td valign="top">My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:<br/>1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes (any orange would :-)<br/>2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No<br/>3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Not sure<br/>4. Extra thoughts:  I like the simplicity of the picture but I don''t find it "talking to me" as a billboard.<br/>Also the background adds some more un-necessary details to the photo. It looks nice with the oranges but does not fit to the billboard concept IMO.<br/>I give you the points just for the photo. As a billboard I''m afraid this doesn''t work  for me (6)</td>', 'My evaluation method of this challenge is as follows:1. Did you catch my eye while I was driving by?  Yes (any orange would :-)2. If I didn''t catch the text while I was driving, did you intrigue me enough to look for this billboard again? No3. Did you sell your stuff to me? Not sure4. Extra thoughts:  I like the simplicity of the picture but I don''t find it "talking to me" as a billboard.Also the background adds some more un-necessary details to the photo. It looks nice with the oranges but does not fit to the billboard concept IMO.I give you the points just for the photo. As a billboard I''m afraid this doesn''t work  for me (6)', '2005-03-04 11:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
