(1208358, 150798, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment: This was a very good idea, and is well done too.</td>', 'Return for comment: This was a very good idea, and is well done too.', '2005-03-04 20:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208359, 150441, 25232, '<td valign="top">Like Monte Python! Good sense of humor.</td>', 'Like Monte Python! Good sense of humor.', '2005-03-04 20:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208361, 150630, 25787, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Great composition, perfect lighting and exposure.   I think I''m going to have to get an orange now.</td>', 'Well done.  Great composition, perfect lighting and exposure.   I think I''m going to have to get an orange now.', '2005-03-04 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208363, 150878, 12253, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous landscape.  Sky seems a bit overexposed or colors are a bit off,  but the land colors and light are fantastic!</td>', 'Gorgeous landscape.  Sky seems a bit overexposed or colors are a bit off,  but the land colors and light are fantastic!', '2005-03-04 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208365, 150559, 25232, '<td valign="top">DAMM!<br/> <br/> <br/>(Drunks Against Mad Mothers)</td>', 'DAMM!  (Drunks Against Mad Mothers)', '2005-03-04 20:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208367, 151119, 21362, '<td valign="top">I like this one but I think I''d like it better with a different background. The negative space is good, but the solid white is kinda boring. With the palm tree print on the packaging, I picture these sitting on a picnic table with a backdrop of blue ocean and sky -- still largely monotone and empty but less dull. Maybe that would work, maybe not. Just an idea...<br/> <br/>That melty cheese is making me hungry. Proves it is an effective ad!!<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'I like this one but I think I''d like it better with a different background. The negative space is good, but the solid white is kinda boring. With the palm tree print on the packaging, I picture these sitting on a picnic table with a backdrop of blue ocean and sky -- still largely monotone and empty but less dull. Maybe that would work, maybe not. Just an idea... That melty cheese is making me hungry. Proves it is an effective ad!! Good job.', '2005-03-04 20:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208368, 150439, 12253, '<td valign="top">Composition and overall this is a great shot.  I do think it might have been better without the bright areas in the central--perhaps a gradient mask and levels adjustment  could have subdued those some.  Still, the subject is strong here and the bright areas do not detract from him like they would in a weaker shot.</td>', 'Composition and overall this is a great shot.  I do think it might have been better without the bright areas in the central--perhaps a gradient mask and levels adjustment  could have subdued those some.  Still, the subject is strong here and the bright areas do not detract from him like they would in a weaker shot.', '2005-03-04 20:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208369, 151096, 21362, '<td valign="top">Good, simple, to the point.</td>', 'Good, simple, to the point.', '2005-03-04 20:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208370, 151122, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Love the tones and the clarity, yet not oversharpened.</td>', 'Great capture.  Love the tones and the clarity, yet not oversharpened.', '2005-03-04 20:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208371, 150730, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  A tad soft, but not alarmingly so.  Such an expressive pup, too!  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  A tad soft, but not alarmingly so.  Such an expressive pup, too!  Well done.', '2005-03-04 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208373, 150798, 25232, '<td valign="top">The absence of all muscle tone would be evident post mortem.</td>', 'The absence of all muscle tone would be evident post mortem.', '2005-03-04 20:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208374, 151023, 19952, '<td valign="top">No matter how many times I see this beach, it still looks beautiful and you''re clearly proficient at shooting landscapes like this. As always, really nice job!</td>', 'No matter how many times I see this beach, it still looks beautiful and you''re clearly proficient at shooting landscapes like this. As always, really nice job!', '2005-03-04 20:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208375, 150559, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  Super shot--love the close crop, the way the colors interplay, and of course the message.</td>', 'Return for comment.  Super shot--love the close crop, the way the colors interplay, and of course the message.', '2005-03-04 20:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208376, 150384, 19952, '<td valign="top">This shot and concept are absolutely brilliant - one of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'This shot and concept are absolutely brilliant - one of my favorites in the challenge.', '2005-03-04 20:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208377, 150887, 12253, '<td valign="top">Return for comment.  Beautifull light and sillouettes and the bird works in perfectly.    Maybe would have been a little better if there was a bit more foreground to include the rest of the boat.</td>', 'Return for comment.  Beautifull light and sillouettes and the bird works in perfectly.    Maybe would have been a little better if there was a bit more foreground to include the rest of the boat.', '2005-03-04 20:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208379, 150998, 18349, '<td valign="top">This would be so much more believeable and better with real people rather than dolls.  But ti''s a strong idea and composed well.  Lighting needs a bit more work, but overall an OK job.  :o)</td>', 'This would be so much more believeable and better with real people rather than dolls.  But ti''s a strong idea and composed well.  Lighting needs a bit more work, but overall an OK job.  :o)', '2005-03-04 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208382, 150937, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best butterfly shots I''ve seen on this site - lots of bright colors and excellent focus/bokeh. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This is one of the best butterfly shots I''ve seen on this site - lots of bright colors and excellent focus/bokeh. Very nicely done.', '2005-03-04 20:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208384, 150703, 22459, '<td valign="top">Excellent image well suited for this challenge. You have captured a unique expression that lures the viewer together with great lighting and composition.</td>', 'Excellent image well suited for this challenge. You have captured a unique expression that lures the viewer together with great lighting and composition.', '2005-03-04 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208385, 150630, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and excellent setup and lighting. Great job!</td>', 'Very nice concept and excellent setup and lighting. Great job!', '2005-03-04 20:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208386, 150824, 22125, '<td valign="top">dont get it sorry, good composition, sharp, but i do not understand the pic. 6</td>', 'dont get it sorry, good composition, sharp, but i do not understand the pic. 6', '2005-03-04 20:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208387, 150903, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, and a great message.  Good expression on the child. I''m not sure I understand the symbolism and metaphor here of the double exposure relative to the message.  Hopefully explained better in your comments when the challenge ends.  Nice shot overall.</td>', 'Nice effect, and a great message.  Good expression on the child. I''m not sure I understand the symbolism and metaphor here of the double exposure relative to the message.  Hopefully explained better in your comments when the challenge ends.  Nice shot overall.', '2005-03-04 20:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208390, 150996, 12253, '<td valign="top">Hopefully, people aren''t being too hard on you for misunderstanding the challenge.  It was not to photograph an existing billboard (as I''m sure you''ve been told by now!)</td>', 'Hopefully, people aren''t being too hard on you for misunderstanding the challenge.  It was not to photograph an existing billboard (as I''m sure you''ve been told by now!)', '2005-03-04 20:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208391, 151106, 18349, '<td valign="top">This would be so perfect if it weren''t for the shadows on the left... I love it!  :o)</td>', 'This would be so perfect if it weren''t for the shadows on the left... I love it!  :o)', '2005-03-04 20:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208395, 150887, 25232, '<td valign="top">This works.</td>', 'This works.', '2005-03-04 20:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208396, 151060, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice setup and a good concept for a billboard. I think the shot is just a little bit bright and would probably look better if there were more to look at in the white spaces on the sides, but it''s still an excellent photo for this challenge. Nice job!</td>', 'This is a really nice setup and a good concept for a billboard. I think the shot is just a little bit bright and would probably look better if there were more to look at in the white spaces on the sides, but it''s still an excellent photo for this challenge. Nice job!', '2005-03-04 20:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208398, 150648, 19952, '<td valign="top">First of all, I love this photo - it''s beautifully lit and nicely processed. Second, if I actually saw this on a billboard, I would probably have at least one accident. :-) Great job!</td>', 'First of all, I love this photo - it''s beautifully lit and nicely processed. Second, if I actually saw this on a billboard, I would probably have at least one accident. :-) Great job!', '2005-03-04 20:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
