(1208503, 151114, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is very original and clever. You lost the light on your subject and there is a bit of glare in the top left corner. Tighten up the technical and you''d have a great billboard here.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is very original and clever. You lost the light on your subject and there is a bit of glare in the top left corner. Tighten up the technical and you''d have a great billboard here.  Good luck!', '2005-03-04 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1);
