(1208535, 151100, 22537, '<td valign="top">You have a good eye in capturing a "smile" on a hood.  The lighing is a bit weak and there is a reflection visible on the hood / bumper. The composition is excellent and the idea is fresh.  Good luck.</td>', 'You have a good eye in capturing a "smile" on a hood.  The lighing is a bit weak and there is a reflection visible on the hood / bumper. The composition is excellent and the idea is fresh.  Good luck.', '2005-03-04 21:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
