(1208927, 150648, 31133, '<td valign="top">I didn''t give you any comments during voting, but gave this one a 10. I''m REALLY surprised this didn''t get a ribbon. Also, I just looked at your profile page - and boy, I''m shocked that you only have one ribbon so far. I would make a bet with anyone that if you continue entering challenges in 2005, at least one of your resolutions will come true! Great job and keep going, please.</td>', 'I didn''t give you any comments during voting, but gave this one a 10. I''m REALLY surprised this didn''t get a ribbon. Also, I just looked at your profile page - and boy, I''m shocked that you only have one ribbon so far. I would make a bet with anyone that if you continue entering challenges in 2005, at least one of your resolutions will come true! Great job and keep going, please.', '2005-03-05 02:38:47.000000', NULL, 0),
