(1208936, 151065, 31133, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. Sorry, I didn''t leave you any comments during voting, but now I''m back to say that it''s disappointing that your score wasn''t higher - at least I wish you had received more comments to indicate why. Your entry fits the challenge perfectly in my opinion. If the background had been non-white, I would''ve given it a 10.</td>', 'I gave this a 9. Sorry, I didn''t leave you any comments during voting, but now I''m back to say that it''s disappointing that your score wasn''t higher - at least I wish you had received more comments to indicate why. Your entry fits the challenge perfectly in my opinion. If the background had been non-white, I would''ve given it a 10.', '2005-03-05 03:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
