(1208989, 150815, 13879, '<td valign="top">LOL<br/>Controversial!<br/>Ahh...the font... I tried to match the one on the bottle... hmmm didnt go down to well. Such a shame i learn how to dodge the day AFTER i submitted, i had to whack up the contrast to get rid of some nasty shadows, I had a go at dodging it this week and i think i would have done alot better!<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments, i really enjoyed this challenge.</td>', 'LOLControversial!Ahh...the font... I tried to match the one on the bottle... hmmm didnt go down to well. Such a shame i learn how to dodge the day AFTER i submitted, i had to whack up the contrast to get rid of some nasty shadows, I had a go at dodging it this week and i think i would have done alot better! Thanks for all the comments, i really enjoyed this challenge.', '2005-03-05 04:22:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1208993, 151023, 20168, '<td valign="top">Oswald West, former governor of Oregon, declared the Oregon beaches to belong to all the people, forbidding anyone to claim one grain of sand from the high tide line out to sea, from Astoria to Brookings as private property.  This billboard is in that same spirit, welcoming all inlanders to come out to dream, to soak up the beauty of the north Oregon Coast.  I love the child on the rock, putting perspective and human story into the scene.  The golden glow is extraordinary.  By the way, the larger rock in the photo is known locally as Lady Rock.  It''s either Lady or Lincoln, I get the two confused.  Congrats on the ribbon, Michael.  Thanks for a great billboard!</td>', 'Oswald West, former governor of Oregon, declared the Oregon beaches to belong to all the people, forbidding anyone to claim one grain of sand from the high tide line out to sea, from Astoria to Brookings as private property.  This billboard is in that same spirit, welcoming all inlanders to come out to dream, to soak up the beauty of the north Oregon Coast.  I love the child on the rock, putting perspective and human story into the scene.  The golden glow is extraordinary.  By the way, the larger rock in the photo is known locally as Lady Rock.  It''s either Lady or Lincoln, I get the two confused.  Congrats on the ribbon, Michael.  Thanks for a great billboard!', '2005-03-05 04:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1208997, 150798, 23458, '<td valign="top">A powerful concept, stunningly executed. Rarely does an image separate itself from the other entries as clearly as this one. <br/> <br/></td>', 'A powerful concept, stunningly executed. Rarely does an image separate itself from the other entries as clearly as this one.  ', '2005-03-05 04:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
