(1209506, 150648, 31637, '<td valign="top">maybe deserved a ribbon, but I think it didnt pull it off because of the viewers are unable to distinguish the subject in the photo. All I could see was the hand, not knowing what part of the body it is touching. Great composition, almost pulled it off, but a spectacular finish nevertheless.</td>', 'maybe deserved a ribbon, but I think it didnt pull it off because of the viewers are unable to distinguish the subject in the photo. All I could see was the hand, not knowing what part of the body it is touching. Great composition, almost pulled it off, but a spectacular finish nevertheless.', '2005-03-05 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 0);
