(1209512, 150630, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great work<br/>Congrats on your Ribbon <br/>Nice clear clean image</td>', 'Great workCongrats on your Ribbon Nice clear clean image', '2005-03-05 15:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1209619, 150853, 32837, '<td valign="top">Just so you all know, I climbed up about 50 feet and then clipped into a botl and hung out taking photos for about an hour while my friends climbed up. <br/>No, he is not free soloing. I just cloned out his rope for a more dynamic effect. Obviously it worked cause more than a few people have had their hearts in their throats over this one! Everything was done very safely and we all had a great day.<br/>Thanks very much for all of your helpful comments and critiscms (sp?). I have learned more than you can possibly imagine in a few short weeks since joining DPC.</td>', 'Just so you all know, I climbed up about 50 feet and then clipped into a botl and hung out taking photos for about an hour while my friends climbed up. No, he is not free soloing. I just cloned out his rope for a more dynamic effect. Obviously it worked cause more than a few people have had their hearts in their throats over this one! Everything was done very safely and we all had a great day.Thanks very much for all of your helpful comments and critiscms (sp?). I have learned more than you can possibly imagine in a few short weeks since joining DPC.', '2005-03-05 17:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
